// **the same program under the JIT**, which is the case that pins the loadable library.
//
// MCJIT resolves an external out of the running echoc process, and `eco_shim_answer` is emphatically not
// in it - so this printing anything at all is the whole assertion. `lib:m` under `run` would not be a
// test, because echoc is itself linked against libm and `sqrt` would resolve with nothing done
echo shim::answer();
